# ── Build artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
target/
*.wasm

# ── Coverage ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
coverage/
lcov.info
*.profraw
*.profdata

# ── Test snapshots ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/test_snapshots/
contracts/invoice/tests/snapshots/
**/*.snap.new
.DS_Store
**/__pycache__/

# ── cargo-fuzz ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Per-target seed corpora and crash artifacts are local iteration state: they are
# machine-generated, machine-specific, and would swamp the diff. Crash artifacts
# are the exception worth keeping — a crash reproducer is valuable, so those are
# intentionally NOT ignored; the ignore below is scoped to corpus/ only.
contracts/*/fuzz/corpus/
